{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37177","headline":"秋 · 翁洮","name":"秋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宋玉高吟思万重，澄澄寰宇振金风。\n云闲日月浮虚白，木落山川叠碎红。\n寥泬鴈多宫漏永，河渠烟歛塞天空。\n侯门处处槐花□，献赋何时遇至公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁洮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37177.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37177","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}